# DataStax Apache Kafka Connector configuration parameter reference
 
Use the sample configuration files as a starting point. 
 
cassandra-sink-distributed.json.sample
 
- The
 cassandra-sink-distributed.json.sample
 file is located in the conf
 directory of the DataStax Apache Kafka Connector
 distribution package.
 
cassandra-sink-standalone.properties.sample
 
- The
 cassandra-sink-standalone.properties.sample
 file is located in the conf
 directory of the DataStax Apache Kafka Connector
 distribution package.
 
To configure the DataStax Apache Kafka™ Connector, use the
 [cassandra-sink-standalone.properties.sample](javascript:;) or
 [cassandra-sink-distributed.json.sample](javascript:;) configuration file as a
 starting point.
